    "enUS": {
      "description": "{name}!  Bink, my gnome colleague in Ironforge, sends word.  She has a task that needs doing and won't rely on anyone but a mage to do it!  Are you that mage, {name}?\n\nIf so, then speak with Bink.  She spends her time in the Hall of Mysteries in the Mystic Ward of Ironforge.",
      "summary": "Speak with Bink in Ironforge.",
      "title": "Speak with Bink",
